WHATNOW

What tamlinux-tools is doing now and what comes next. Read this first;
revise it at the end of every session (work/README-work).

Updated: 2026-11-20, with W4


STATE

  Version 0.1.0 on branch dev. Follows the tam-idol 0.2.0 standard (W4).
  Standalone Tamlinux utilities in C linked statically against libtam
  0.8.0 or later.

  - tam-journal 0.1.0 (src/tam-journal.c): daily plain-text journal in
    Micro (docs/plans/plain-text-journal.md).
  - tam-file-select (src/tam-file-select.c): file chooser through the
    desktop portal (libtam-portal).

  tam-bundle has been retired; both remaining tools use
  tam_install_pending() from libtam 0.8.0. Pre-2026-11-17 session
  records live in work/history/.


